===================================================================

You will work with a dataset of 50 houses with the following features:

Size (sq ft) – living area

Bedrooms – number of bedrooms

Bathrooms – number of bathrooms

Age (years) – age of the house

Lot Size (sq ft) – total land area

Garage – number of garage spaces

Price – target variable (in thousands $)

Generate the dataset using the Python code below:

python
import pandas as pd
import numpy as np

np.random.seed(42)   # for reproducibility

n = 50
